# ThreadSanitizer suppressions of the sanitizers job (BuildAndTest.yml).
#
# No race suppression: the Linux interface loop creates/removes its single GLib source on the interface thread.
# Other threads signal an eventfd and publish their work through the C++ host/stop mutexes (#542).
#
# This holds because the sanitizers job configures -DWEBFRONT_EMBED_WEBKITGTK=OFF: the WebKitGTK adapter still
# queues work with g_idle_add_full, which GLib orders with futexes ThreadSanitizer cannot see. A job that runs
# WebKitGTK under TSan must restore `race:libglib-2.0.so` (a race is then suppressed only when one of its stacks
# goes through libglib; WebFront's own code stays checked).
